        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: America Is Dying Slowly\n- Organizations: Red Hot Organization, Red Hot AIDS Benefit Series\n- People: De La Soul, Mobb Deep, Coolio, Biz Markie, Chubb Rock, The Lost Boyz, Pete Rock, Common, Wu-Tang Clan\n- Places: Long Island, New York\n\nFacts:\n- De La Soul is an American hip hop trio formed in 1987 on Long Island, New York.\n- America Is Dying Slowly is a compilation album whose title is a backronym for AIDS.\n- America Is Dying Slowly is the eighth album in the Red Hot AIDS Benefit Series recorded by the Red Hot Organization.\n- America Is Dying Slowly featured collaborations from hip hop acts including Mobb Deep, De La Soul, Coolio, Biz Markie, Chubb Rock, The Lost Boyz, Pete Rock, Common, and Wu-Tang Clan.",
